{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/extras/Necro4k.png?t=1747713532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The undead scorge:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Neither living nor truly dead, these tormented souls wander the world, bearing the cursed legacy of the fallen necromancer. From pitiful corpses to fallen champions, from grotesque abominations to witches of ancient ages, they shall stand as your greatest and most harrowing challenge within the depths of NECRODUNGEON.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/extras/TheScourge.png?t=1747713532\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The powers:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the blessing of the last priest, you carry the power to forge fallen souls into divine strength. In NECRODUNGEON, you will choose from a wide array of powers, each with unique upgrades, shaping a gameplay experience that is truly your own. A master of the blade? A weaver of ancient magic? A relentless hunter? Or perhaps a force that commands all paths at once? What powers will you unleash?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/extras/Powers.png?t=1747713532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The holy relics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scattered across the dying world, sacred relics hold the key to a ritual that could turn the tide against darkness. From the depths of the NECRODUNGEON to the stench of cursed swamps, through deadly labyrinths to burning wastelands \u2014 the path is treacherous, the reward is salvation. Will you rise and claim the relics before all is lost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/extras/Relics.png?t=1747713532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Free the world or die trying.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728400?t=1747713532","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/afc2e6f367abf1848dec576f5890f3e2cfb59fd1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747713532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/c418c6e8dcd50a9dbfd512a88a9f414e4cbcd172/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747713532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/c418c6e8dcd50a9dbfd512a88a9f414e4cbcd172/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747713532","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/extras/Necro4k.png?t=1747713532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The undead scorge:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Neither living nor truly dead, these tormented souls wander the world, bearing the cursed legacy of the fallen necromancer. From pitiful corpses to fallen champions, from grotesque abominations to witches of ancient ages, they shall stand as your greatest and most harrowing challenge within the depths of NECRODUNGEON.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/extras/TheScourge.png?t=1747713532\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The powers:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the blessing of the last priest, you carry the power to forge fallen souls into divine strength. In NECRODUNGEON, you will choose from a wide array of powers, each with unique upgrades, shaping a gameplay experience that is truly your own. A master of the blade? A weaver of ancient magic? A relentless hunter? Or perhaps a force that commands all paths at once? What powers will you unleash?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/extras/Powers.png?t=1747713532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The holy relics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scattered across the dying world, sacred relics hold the key to a ritual that could turn the tide against darkness. From the depths of the NECRODUNGEON to the stench of cursed swamps, through deadly labyrinths to burning wastelands \u2014 the path is treacherous, the reward is salvation. Will you rise and claim the relics before all is lost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/extras/Relics.png?t=1747713532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Free the world or die trying.</strong></h2>","developers":["Masseli Art"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728400/3626208b66b71a865bf7169ddd3c0e2e7e97150f/header.jpg?t=1747713532","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.14 (Mojave) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Apple Silicon or Intel x64<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136636,"